{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_09_title", "source_sha256": "f27ecc0b05ace7731a52fdc1835ff5a8bdee8ce03f01d1393fb60029aabbeae7", "ja": "～ピカピカに輝く存在～", "zh": "～闪闪发光的存在～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_09_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2735eeebf72e34047f3e7a73cb0fb8b636e5f38aafdcee8768fdddf6cfe9845d", "ja": "立派なステージを見て、意気込みを新たに\nする伊織、麗花、まつり、千鶴。伊織は、\nピカ～って光り輝ける、という麗花の言葉に\n引っかかりを感じるが、本番は自分たちも\n輝こうと、4人の気持ちはひとつになった。", "zh": "看到气派的舞台后，伊织、丽花、茉莉和千鹤重新鼓起了干劲。丽花说自己能闪闪发光，这让伊织感到有些在意，不过她们也下定决心要在正式演出中绽放光芒，4人的心因此团结在了一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_09_1000_021mat", "source_sha256": "fef3a3b8d02b580031aa0363895b59c20a78b75e0b29d5f80e26be2dbd38b56d", "ja": "わんだほー！なステージなのです。これに負けない\nくらいのキラキラな気持ちで、本番に備えるのですよ。", "zh": "这是超棒的舞台呢。我们也要怀着不输给它的闪耀心情，为正式演出做好准备哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_09_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "71f8ca5e1364d70c6edeb38318dee0ffd01292acaea201da517bf618a9f19761", "ja": "もちろんよ。しっかりレッスンしてきたし、\nあとはリハで確かめて、本番で実践できれば……。", "zh": "当然了。我已经认真练习过了，接下来只要在彩排时确认一下，并在正式演出时发挥出来就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_09_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "a6fe3a43bc33a817771b50a304d06faa80463ed16222f4b9f509a1e8fecc7307", "ja": "大丈夫！　伊織ちゃんは絶対できる！\nピカ～って光り輝けるよ！", "zh": "没问题的！伊织肯定能做到！\n一定会闪闪发光哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_09_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "c9449135b2e62ab7afe735fb3008e81aa2b8b3c88327c1a84c9e1d57aad50051", "ja": "ピカ～、……って麗花、なんか引っかかる言い方ね。\nいったい私のどこを見てそう言ったわけ？", "zh": "说什么“闪闪发光”……丽花，你这说法总觉得有点让人在意啊。  \n你到底是看着我的哪儿，才这么说的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_09_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "66793e6d29516117662837e8723bbbe9bb3da674f72c16157fbbcf7c98d626cf", "ja": "どこって、伊織ちゃんの全身、全部だよ？\nカワイイおデコだけじゃなくて♪", "zh": "哪里？当然是伊织全身上下，全部呀？不只是可爱的额头哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_09_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "fd62aa0261a6fbfb5c6c826d064839a390c048ba89ed9be74b0337645fbd500d", "ja": "ま、まあそうですわね。魅力的なアイドルは、\nまばゆいばかりのオーラを放つものですから……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯，确实如此。富有魅力的偶像，\n本来就会散发出耀眼夺目的气场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_09_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "438bbcb8d4bec31eeae385dcd985e7d8b2a61695b18d896b0f870a4561c8768d", "ja": "そうなのです。女の子はみんな、素敵な舞台に上がれば\nキラキラでピカピカな存在になれるのです。", "zh": "就是这样。女孩子们只要登上精彩的舞台，\n就都能成为闪闪发光、熠熠生辉的存在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_09_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "6b9e2e17fd9447636ef5aa8f1f35fd52fe4d84fd50bf5547504853f46268f6a4", "ja": "まあ……言いたいことは分かるけど。……そうね！\nみんな、本番はしっかり輝くわよ！", "zh": "不过……我也明白你想表达什么。……好！\n大家，正式演出时可要全力闪耀起来哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_09_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "9652fba57c5ca8c17de6af24903b61bbda2e4f8875cdd928aa2319398ff0912b", "ja": "お任せくださいませ。セレブらしく、ゴージャスな\nステージにしてみせますわよ、おーほっほっほ！", "zh": "请交给我吧。我会以名媛的风范，把舞台打造得华丽无比，哦呵呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_09_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "67a2f2bb6a4f0e5c1084b3f4dbabbf24ca95236a2157ae8086084e56240ecc75", "ja": "うん！　みんなでピッカピカになっちゃおう！", "zh": "嗯！大家一起变得闪闪发光吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_09_1010_audience", "source_sha256": "d4a24de7732f4fc96422562f5cbf6af59494bc5a2eff23580ef50ef09e85feb2", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアアアアアア！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_09_1011_038chz", "source_sha256": "a425a4d7bac95dbc225975b28c8f3a117d4f1f180631fe888ceaa6d2d95bc8e0", "ja": "みなさん、今日は記念すべき日です。磨き上げられた\nわたくし達の姿、どうかご堪能なさいませ！", "zh": "各位，今天是值得纪念的日子。还请尽情欣赏我们精心打磨后的身姿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_09_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "2d001480cfba9b8b70f523090553dd898b347438ae1ce742f7b301ebd2152677", "ja": "姫達が、らぶりー！でキラキラな\n魔法の時間を、みんなにお届けするのです！", "zh": "公主们会为大家献上\n可爱又闪亮的魔法时光哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_09_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "3b2b326906ad19214ec7bce79d83c8a5e3f4cdc3f90dbf7373b961a25e7d672e", "ja": "ピッカピカでカワイイ伊織ちゃん達のこと、\nみんな、最後までしっかり応援してね～！", "zh": "大家要一直为闪闪发光又可爱的伊织她们加油到最后哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_09_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "5a73c51cc2656081981a09db7770aa8d3a1b4dab9a7c99056b87300c623338e6", "ja": "それじゃあ、せーのーで行きますよっ！\nせーの……キラーンっ！！", "zh": "那么，大家一起喊——预备——！\n预备……闪亮登场！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
